$version Derived from actual Wokwi input-only pin observer $end
$comment Partial capture: first two ADC reads and a leading BUSY edge of the next conversion. Not a downloaded full-session logic-analyzer VCD; no physical measurements. $end
$timescale 1ns $end
$scope module virtual_probe $end
$var wire 1 ! CONVST $end
$var wire 1 " BUSY $end
$var wire 1 # CS $end
$var wire 1 $ SCLK $end
$var wire 1 % DOUTA $end
$var wire 1 & FOOT_IRQ $end
$var wire 1 ' SHANK_IRQ $end
$var wire 1 ( FOOT_CS $end
$var wire 1 ) RESET $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
